# Revelation 12 with 17 verses. Standing on the sand of the sea (12:18 in
# Nestle-Aland and eng.vrs) is either the start of 13:1 (KJV: "And I stood
# upon the sand of the sea"; NIV, AMP) or the end of 12:17 (ESV, KRV, ARA).
# Either way 12:1-17 keep their numbers and 12:18 has no verse of its own;
# chapter 13 is numbered as usual.
REV 12:1-17 = REV 12:1-17
